        "original_id": "e7608366-0df0-5b0d-ad13-5c8df48aa1c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John de Mol Jr.\n- Companies: Talpa Holding, SBS Broadcasting B.V., SBS Broadcasting Group\n- Products: NET 5, Big Brother\n- Places: The Hague, the Netherlands\n\nFacts:\n- John de Mol Jr. was born on 24 April 1955 in The Hague.\n- John de Mol Jr. is a Dutch media tycoon.\n- John de Mol Jr. created the Big Brother reality game show franchise.\n- Big Brother was originally broadcast in the Netherlands and was later syndicated internationally.\n- Talpa Holding is the company to which John de Mol Jr. transferred all of his media activities.\n- NET 5 is a Dutch commercial TV channel.\n- NET 5 was formerly part of SBS Broadcasting Group.\n- NET 5 is owned by SBS Broadcasting B.V. and is now owned by Talpa Holding.",
